# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/
*.swp
*.swo

# LLM coding tools (per-machine state, not project config)
.cursor/
.codeium/
.continue/
.aider*
.codex/
.openai/

# Build artifacts
# public/ holds Astro's static input (publicDir). Tracked: 4 SEO statics
# (og.png, robots.txt, llms.txt, llms-full.txt). Untracked: every TS-ETL
# output below — Vercel regenerates them on each deploy via `npm run build:data`.
public/data.*
public/map-thumb.snippet.html

# Astro build output (Vercel deploy target — built fresh in CI, not committed).
dist-astro/
# Astro internal cache (auto-generated types, content collection metadata)
.astro/

# Local-only orphan dirs from the historical Python pipeline (Track A-D era).
# Cannot be regenerated — Python is gone — but Dropbox sync makes deletion
# unreliable. Ignored so they don't appear in `git status`. Safe to delete
# manually when Dropbox releases its file locks.
dist.next/
dist-py.next/
dist-ts/

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log

# Local-only dev artifacts (don't ship to public repo)
.claude/
_audit/
.vercel

# Refactor snapshot hashes (created on demand by audit / refactor flows to
# byte-diff outputs before/after a change). Always temporary.
.snapshot-*.txt

# Build-time caches kept outside publicDir so they're never served to the
# web. Currently used by src/data/build.ts for the post-promote manifest.
.cache/

# Python virtual env (this project is TS-only; venvs are operator-local
# tooling like IDE extensions, not part of the project).
.venv/

# Credentials — never commit these (defensive patterns; real credentials should
# live OUTSIDE the repo, e.g. ~/.config/mirai-shigoto/)
*-sa.json
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
gcp-*.json

# Personal monitoring/dashboards cheatsheet — local-only operator reference,
# contains direct dashboard URLs and account-specific paths. Not source code.
analytics/dashboards.md

# Local-only preview / scratch HTML files. Names starting with `_` are draft.
_*.html

# api/og-renderers/ — esbuild output of src/lib/og-renderers/*.tsx,
# regenerated on every `pnpm build` by scripts/build-og-renderers.cjs.
# Tracked sources live at src/lib/og-renderers/*.tsx. The directory
# exists only at build time so Vercel's Edge bundler can resolve
# api/og.tsx's `./og-renderers/<name>.js` imports.
api/og-renderers/

# docs/ — design / planning markdown は原則ローカル only、GitHub に同期しない。
# 例外: Design.md と Design-Mobile.md は日本語化完了済 (2026-05-13 Phase A.5)、
# 公開して開発者向け仕様として共有する。
# 注: ディレクトリ自体 `docs/` を ignore すると `!` revert は効かないため、
# `docs/*` で中身を ignore し、個別ファイルを `!` で revert する書き方が必須。
# サブディレクトリ (docs/_archive 等) は `docs/*` で暗黙的に ignored。
docs/*
!docs/Design.md
!docs/Design-Mobile.md

